{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"RLSA-2026:97215","published":"2026-11-13T06:06:59.212490Z","modified":"2026-11-13T06:30:02.506675555Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-27136","CVE-2026-32280","CVE-2026-33810"],"summary":"Important: grafana security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":"Grafana is an open source, feature rich metrics dashboard and graph editor for Graphite, InfluxDB & OpenTSDB. \n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* crypto/x509: golang: Go crypto/x509: Certificate validation bypass due to incorrect DNS constraint application (CVE-2026-33810)\n\n* crypto/x509: crypto/tls: golang: Go: Denial of Service vulnerability in certificate chain building (CVE-2026-32280)\n\n* golang.org/x/net/html: golang: golang.org/x/net/html: Cross-Site Scripting via HTML parsing bypass (CVE-2026-27136)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Rebase to grafana 12.4.3 (JIRA:Rocky Linux-171604)\n\n* [grafana / rhel-10.3] Remove Lua ExclusiveArch macro for Konflux build (JIRA:Rocky Linux-188283)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n\nAdditional Changes:\n\nFor detailed information on changes in this release, see the Rocky Linux 10 Release Notes linked from the References section.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"grafana-selinux","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/grafana-selinux?distro=rocky-linux-10&epoch=0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0:12.4.3-2.el10"}],"database_specific":{"yum_repository":"AppStream"}}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://storage.googleapis.com/resf-osv-data/RLSA-2026:97215.json"}},{"package":{"name":"grafana","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/grafana?distro=rocky-linux-10&epoch=0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0:12.4.3-2.el10"}],"database_specific":{"yum_repository":"AppStream"}}],"database_